---
import Star from './Star.astro';
import { principles } from '../data/profile';
---
<section id="about" class="about-section" aria-labelledby="about-title">
  <div class="container about-grid">
    <div class="about-heading"><p class="eyebrow section-label"><span>02 /</span> THE PERSON BEHIND THE WORK</p><h2 id="about-title">Lagos roots.<br />A wider <em>lens.</em></h2><Star class="about-star" /></div>
    <div class="about-copy"><p class="large-copy">I grew up in Lagos, moved to Canada at 18, and found my way from engineering into entrepreneurship.</p><p>At the University of Ottawa, I switched from mechanical engineering to software engineering because I wanted to go deeper into programming. That curiosity has kept taking me into new territory.</p><p>I’ve worked at Morgan Stanley, Ford, and Kinaxis, helped build Software for Love, and co-founded Minicor. Alongside technology, I own an oil palm plantation and a layer poultry farm.</p><p>The thread through all of it is simple: <strong>I want to build businesses that make Nigeria more independent.</strong> That means thinking about what we can create, grow, and build for ourselves.</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="container background-line"><span class="eyebrow">A FEW STOPS ALONG THE WAY</span><div><span>University of Ottawa</span><span>Morgan Stanley</span><span>Ford</span><span>Kinaxis</span><span>Y Combinator</span></div></div>
</section>
<section id="perspective" class="section container perspective-section" aria-labelledby="perspective-title">
  <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow section-label"><span>03 /</span> HOW I THINK</p><h2 id="perspective-title">A few things<br />I come <em>back to.</em></h2></div><p>Working principles, shaped by building.<br />Always open to being refined.</p></div>
  <div class="principles">{principles.map((principle, i) => <details class="principle"><summary><span class="principle-number">0{i + 1}</span><h3>{principle.title}</h3><span class="expand-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="note-body"><p>{principle.text}</p></div></details>)}</div>
  <div class="interests">
    <div class="interests-intro"><span class="eyebrow">OFF THE CLOCK</span><h3>Still <em>curious.</em></h3></div>
    <div class="interest"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="15" cy="15" r="10"/><circle cx="49" cy="15" r="10"/><circle cx="15" cy="49" r="10"/><circle cx="49" cy="49" r="10"/><path d="m15 15 34 34m0-34L15 49"/><rect x="24" y="24" width="16" height="16" rx="4"/></svg><div><h4>Drones & defense tech</h4><p>A fascination with the systems that move through, see, and protect the physical world.</p></div></div>
    <div class="interest"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 43V25c0-9 5-16 13-16h7c8 0 13 7 13 15v17l-6 9H23l-7-7Z"/><path d="M16 35c-9-7-13 0-8 8l11 10m4-3v9h20v-9M24 22h15M24 29h15"/></svg><div><h4>MMA & boxing</h4><p>The discipline. The strategy. The craft.<br />A different kind of problem-solving.</p></div></div>
  </div>
</section>
